WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:08.080
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a surreal black comedy dystopian film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:15.920
“The Lobster.” Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:23.360
In the near dystopian future, not being in a&nbsp;
relationship is considered a crime. To survive in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:28.880
the world, one should always be with a romantic&nbsp;
partner. People must go everywhere with their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:35.120
partners or else they are punishable by law.&nbsp;
The newly single people are brought to a hotel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:39.920
that gives them a chance to find a romantic&nbsp;
partner in the course of forty-five days.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:46.400
If they are unable to find one, they are turned&nbsp;
into an animal of their choice through a modern&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:52.320
technique. The opening scene of the movie shows&nbsp;
us a woman driving down a road until she reaches a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:57.840
field with small donkeys. She gets out of her car&nbsp;
and shoots one of the donkeys until it is dead.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:04.240
The protagonist of the movie is an architect&nbsp;
named David. His wife has recently left him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:09.680
for another man, so he has been brought to the&nbsp;
hotel to find another partner. David is with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:16.320
his dog, Bob who used to be his brother but was&nbsp;
transformed for having no romantic partner. 
&nbsp;

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:22.000
To check into the hotel, David signs a paper&nbsp;
and is interviewed by a hotel staff member.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.880
According to the rules of dating, the couple&nbsp;
should have a common defining characteristic.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:31.360
David’s defining characteristic is that he&nbsp;
is shortsighted, meaning, he should look for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:37.040
a partner who is shortsighted as well. David also&nbsp;
reveals that he had been with his wife for eleven&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:45.840
years but she left him for another short-sighted&nbsp;
man. After that, he is taken to his room and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:50.720
is briefed about the rules of the hotel by the&nbsp;
manager and her husband. When the manager asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:56.240
him what kind of animal he would be if he doesn’t&nbsp;
find a partner, David replies that he wants to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:01.280
a lobster because they live for over a hundred&nbsp;
years and are fertile throughout their life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:07.520
He also adds that he loves the sea and is quite&nbsp;
good at swimming. The manager praises his choice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:13.440
of animal claiming that most choose to be dogs&nbsp;
which affects the ecosystem and animal food chain.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:19.040
Before they leave, the hotel’s maid cuffs&nbsp;
one of David’s hands to keep him from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:27.120
pleasuring himself against the hotel’s rules. 
The following day at breakfast, he makes friends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:34.320
with two men, one who speaks with a lisp, Robert,&nbsp;
and one who walks with a limp, John. They both&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:39.440
are searching for girls with the same attributes&nbsp;
as them. While skimming through the dining area,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:45.440
they notice a woman whose nose always bleeds and a&nbsp;
woman who is heartless. But there is no one whose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:51.360
attributes align with theirs. Later, during an&nbsp;
assembly, the singles are called up to speak and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:57.040
talk about their unique qualities. John says that&nbsp;
he acquired his limp when he visited his mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:03.840
who had turned into a wolf. He is here because&nbsp;
his wife died some time ago. Similarly, the others&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:08.960
share their experiences. Throughout the day, the&nbsp;
signals are given opportunities to talk to their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:14.560
potential partners. At a dance party, David&nbsp;
asks the nosebleed girl to dance with him but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:20.800
realizes that they do not have a common attribute.&nbsp;
Following that, they are called to go to the woods&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:26.960
to hunt the Loners. Loners are the people who ran&nbsp;
away from the hotel because they didn’t want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:31.760
be turned into animals. Since the police in&nbsp;
the city would send them back to the hotel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:36.880
they form a colony and stay in the woods.
The singles are allowed to hunt them by shooting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:42.880
them with tranquilizers. Then, the loners are&nbsp;
brought back to the hotel and turned into animals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:47.760
The number of Lonars the singles catch will be&nbsp;
added to the number of days they have left in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:54.320
the hotel. On the first day, David catches none,&nbsp;
meaning that his days are going down rapidly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:59.040
The best hunter among the singles is&nbsp;
the heartless woman who kills about ten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:05.120
in a single hunt. The hotel also has weird rules&nbsp;
that at night, the maid should arouse the men,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:10.320
so they are interested in finding a partner&nbsp;
quicker. One day, Robert is found pleasuring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:19.200
himself and as a punishment, his hand is&nbsp;
burnt in a toaster. In their next hunt,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:24.160
David sits next to the woman whose characteristic&nbsp;
feature is that she likes butter biscuits.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:30.640
She talks to David who shows no interest in her,&nbsp;
even when she offers sexual favors. While talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:36.080
she reveals that she plans to jump off the window&nbsp;
of her room if she doesn’t get a partner in time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:42.400
During a swimming season, John, the guy who&nbsp;
limps, hits his nose making it bleed. He then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:47.600
approaches the nosebleed girl, lying that his nose&nbsp;
bleeds all the time, to match their attributes.
&nbsp;

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:53.440
At the next evening party, John and the nosebleed&nbsp;
girl are pronounced a couple and are shifted to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.440 --> 00:05:00.080
double room. A few days later, the butter biscuits&nbsp;
girl jumps off her window and commits suicide. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:06.000
ruthless girl watches her whimper in pain but&nbsp;
doesn’t get up to help her. David only has a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:11.520
week left to find himself a girl, so he approaches&nbsp;
the heartless girl acting like he doesn’t care for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:17.520
people’s lives either. The woman is looking for&nbsp;
someone who has no emotions, like her, so she is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:23.600
attracted to David. They hang out and talk for a&nbsp;
while, throughout which, David keeps on the act.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:29.360
One day, they are in a hot tub where the woman&nbsp;
fakes her death to see if David cares. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:35.600
he stays in his seat and ignores her completely.&nbsp;
This makes the woman realize that he is actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:41.120
like her and she starts to date him. They are&nbsp;
even put together in a double room and allowed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:47.600
perform activities reserved for only couples, like&nbsp;
playing tennis and sitting at a table for two. 
&nbsp;

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:52.880
They stay as a couple for a few days but the&nbsp;
ruthless girl notices David showing emotions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:59.120
when they get intimate. So, one morning, she&nbsp;
kicks his brother dog to death to test him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:05.520
David says that it is no problem at first but&nbsp;
then, the woman finds him crying in the bathroom.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:10.640
She drags him through the hallways to take him&nbsp;
to the manager for lying but David knocks her out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:17.200
with a tranquilizer gun before she can. The maid&nbsp;
watches him do so and promises to not tell anyone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.760 --> 00:06:22.960
To take revenge for his brother, David thinks of&nbsp;
kicking her in the stomach again and again but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:28.960
settles to another plan. He and the maid get her&nbsp;
to the transformation room and turn her into an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:35.280
animal. Following that, David runs away from the&nbsp;
hotel once and for all. In the woods, he meets a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:40.960
group of loners and their leader. One might think&nbsp;
he is finally with good people but the leader is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:46.400
as ruthless as the hotel manager. She punishes&nbsp;
the loners for having a romantic or sexual&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:51.840
relationship with each other. They also inform&nbsp;
David that two people’s lips were cut off a few&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:57.280
days ago because they were flirting. After they&nbsp;
explain the rules, he is welcomed to the group.
&nbsp;

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:03.200
One of the loner girls with black hair and&nbsp;
shortsightedness like David looks at him for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:09.120
the first time and is instantly attracted to him.&nbsp;
But because of the Loner’s rule, she only talks to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:15.440
him as a friend. In the evening, when the hotel&nbsp;
guests come for the hunt, Robert catches David.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:20.880
David tries to save his life claiming that Robert&nbsp;
is his best friend but the guy is adamant about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:26.560
catching him because he has only two days left.&nbsp;
The black-haired girl hits him from behind and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:32.800
saves David’s life. At the same time, we see&nbsp;
the maid of the hotel meeting the leader Loner.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:37.600
It turns out that the two meet every time she&nbsp;
comes hunting to inform the leader about what is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:43.520
going on at the hotel. The maid is not happy with&nbsp;
her husband but doesn’t want to leave him because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:49.520
she will end up in the hotel as a guest. So, she&nbsp;
and the leader are planning to attack the hotel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:55.760
and take over it. Once every month, two people&nbsp;
from the loners pretend to be a couple and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.760 --> 00:08:01.920
go outside to the city to get food and other&nbsp;
supplies. This time, the leader and her partner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:08.160
take the black-haired girl and David. In the mall,&nbsp;
a police officer sees David alone and questions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:12.560
him about his partner demanding a marriage&nbsp;
certificate from him. But the dark-haired&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:18.800
girl saves him from the man. Some days later, the&nbsp;
loners finally get ready to attack the hotel. 
&nbsp;

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:25.520
That night, they sneak inside with the maid’s&nbsp;
help and hold the manager and her husband hostage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:30.160
They ask the husband to shoot his wife&nbsp;
dead if he wants to save his life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:35.440
The guy doesn’t care about his wife at all so&nbsp;
he shoots her without hesitating. But It turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:40.000
out that the gun was unloaded and the purpose&nbsp;
of the abduction was to show the couple they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:46.560
do not care about each other and are in a hollow&nbsp;
relationship. At the same time, David visits John&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:52.080
and the nosebleed girl and reveals to her that he&nbsp;
is faking the nosebleed so they would be together.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:58.160
The loners leave abruptly after proving their&nbsp;
point and return back to the woods. That night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:03.200
the maid joins the loner group. In the course&nbsp;
of the next few days, the black-haired girl and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:09.040
David get closer and start liking each other. They&nbsp;
even plan to run away from the group so they could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:14.480
be together. The girl writes all of this in her&nbsp;
journal. But before they can execute their plan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:20.400
the leader reads the journal and gets to know&nbsp;
about their affair. She is enraged by the betrayal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:26.400
but doesn’t confront them. Instead, some days&nbsp;
later, she takes the dark-haired girl to the city&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:31.520
claiming that she will fix her shortsightedness,&nbsp;
but instead, makes her go blind. 
&nbsp;

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:37.760
After returning to the woods, the dark-haired girl&nbsp;
finds out what is going on and tries to kill the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:44.000
leader. In the attempt, she kills the hotel’s&nbsp;
maid instead. The leader spares her and lets her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:50.480
go to David. At first, she tries to hide the fact&nbsp;
that she has gone blind but then comes clean. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:55.680
is scared that he will leave her, now that they&nbsp;
do not have any matching attributes. David is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.680 --> 00:10:00.880
unsettled, but decides that he wants to stay with&nbsp;
her, and helps her out with her other senses of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:06.240
touch and smell. For the next few days, they try&nbsp;
to find other attributes that they might have in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:12.800
common but are unsuccessful. David doesn’t want to&nbsp;
let go of her so he suggests they kill the leader&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:18.960
and run away from the woods. They put their plan&nbsp;
into action at night. David abducts the leader&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:25.600
and throws her into an open grave. A while later,&nbsp;
some wild dogs approach her and start devouring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:31.520
her body. Meanwhile, he and the dark-haired&nbsp;
girl dress up and run away from the woods.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:37.600
Eventually, they stop at a diner in the city.&nbsp;
David has decided to blind himself so the two have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:43.840
matching qualities. They talk for a while about&nbsp;
the decision and ask the waiter for a knife. David&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:51.680
gets up and goes to the bathroom to blind himself&nbsp;
but stops midway. The movie ends abruptly, without&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:57.280
showing if they ever lived a normal life. 
